<title>USA: Digital Equipment gets VA contract.</title>
<headline>Digital Equipment gets VA contract.</headline>
<dateline>MAYNARD, Mass. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Equipment Corp said on Wednesday that it has been selected by the U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs to supply computer hardware and software as part of the Procurement for Computer Hardware and Software contract with a potential value of $1.5 billion over five years.</p>
<p>The contract is for one year and has four one-year renewal options.</p>
